342 0 obj
<<
/A 3189 0 R
/Alt (Flowchart illustrating participant selection for a PCOS study from 2008 to present, outlining inclusion and exclusion criteria at each stage. Begins with 16,415 V1 participants, narrows to 13,051, then 7,332 retain full reproductive data, further excludes for age, consent, and complete covariates, culminating in a final descriptive sample of 1,740 PCOS and 1,510 mPCOS participants. Key decision points and sample sizes are shown in color-coded boxes aligned with a timeline on the left.)
/K [31 3190 0 R]
/P 109 0 R
/Pg 51 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (FIGURE 1)
/Type /StructElem
>>
endobj
